    <string name="battery_more">Guide for your phone</string>
    <string name="battery_generic">On some {0} phones also check the app\'s battery settings: set “Unrestricted” and allow background activity.</string>
    <string name="battery_xiaomi">{0}: Settings → Apps → OpenTraceTrack → Battery saver → “No restrictions”, and turn on “Autostart”. In recent apps, lock OpenTraceTrack (padlock).</string>
    <string name="battery_samsung">{0}: Settings → Apps → OpenTraceTrack → Battery → “Unrestricted”. Also make sure the app is not on the “Sleeping apps” list in Device care.</string>
    <string name="battery_huawei">{0}: Settings → Battery → App launch → OpenTraceTrack → manage manually and turn on all three options.</string>
    <string name="battery_oppo">{0}: Settings → Battery → OpenTraceTrack → allow background activity and auto launch. Lock the app in recent apps.</string>
    <string name="battery_vivo">{0}: Settings → Battery → Background power consumption → OpenTraceTrack → allow. Also turn on Autostart in i Manager.</string>
